    <!-- About -->
    <string name="about_body">Bubble Blast is a fully offline casual arcade game. No account, no internet connection and no ads required to play.\n\nPop groups of three or more bubbles, drop the clusters hanging underneath them and beat the target score before you run out of moves.</string>
